{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"马可·奥勒留·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"marcus-aurelius","categoryLabel":"马可·奥勒留","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/14_marcus-aurelius/1_life-and-times","introMarkdown":"# 生平与时代\n\n本卷是马可·奥勒留知识库的\"传记\"分卷，回答一个看似简单却容易被空话搪塞的问题：这个人究竟经历了什么，使他成为我们今天所知的\"哲学家皇帝\"。这里关注的是史实——确切的年份、地名、人物与事件——而不是对其思想的抽象赞美。本库的其他分卷分别处理他的核心贡献、思想方法、主要著作、影响遗产与争议评价；本卷则提供贯穿这一切的时间骨架。\n\n读者对象是想认真了解马可·奥勒留生平的普通读者：不需要任何古典学背景，但希望读到具体、可核查、不含套话的叙述。因此本卷尽量把\"显赫家世\"\"良好教育\"这类笼统说法，落实为可指认的人与书——比如哈德良的赏识、弗龙托的修辞训练、鲁斯提库斯引介的爱比克泰德。\n\n全卷按时间顺序分为三章。第一章\"通向皇位之路\"讲他公元 121 年生于罗马、本名 Marcus Annius Verus，经由两次收养、于 138 年被纳入继承序列的过程。第二章\"哲学家皇帝\"讲他 161 年即位后的共治、施政，以及帕提亚战争、安东尼瘟疫、马科曼尼战争三重危机。第三章\"晚年\"讲他长驻多瑙河前线、在军营中用希腊文写下《沉思录》，直至 180 年卒于征途、传位康茂德、终结\"五贤帝\"时代。\n\n读完本卷，你应当能在脑中拉出一条清晰的生平时间线，并理解一个关键的因果：为什么一位帝国皇帝会在战火与瘟疫中，写下一本写给自己的哲学札记。要深入他在这本札记里究竟思考了什么，可转向\"思想方法\"与\"主要著作\"两卷。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"path-to-the-throne","title":"通向皇位之路","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/path-to-the-throne","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-education","title":"早年与教育","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/path-to-the-throne/early-life-and-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adopted-heir-of-empire","title":"被收为帝国继承人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/path-to-the-throne/adopted-heir-of-empire"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-philosopher-emperor","title":"哲学家皇帝","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/the-philosopher-emperor","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reign-and-responsibilities","title":"统治与责任","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/the-philosopher-emperor/reign-and-responsibilities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wars-and-hardships","title":"战争与磨难","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/the-philosopher-emperor/wars-and-hardships"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-frontier-and-meditations","title":"边疆与《沉思录》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/final-years/the-frontier-and-meditations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"death-and-succession","title":"逝世与继承","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/life-and-times/final-years/death-and-succession"}]}]}